Package: nova-c-touch
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Nova-C OS <novacore.iq@gmail.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: nova-c-desktop (>= 0.2.0), maliit-keyboard, iio-sensor-proxy
Description: Touchscreen support for Nova-C OS (on-screen keyboard)
 Nova-C OS is built for laptops with a real keyboard, so the default image leaves out the on-screen keyboard (it
 pulls in about 200 MB of input-method data). Install this package on a touchscreen laptop or 2-in-1 to get it,
 plus screen auto-rotation:  sudo apt install nova-c-touch
